---
// Labels driving the report-level decode/prefill radios.
//
// The inputs themselves live once at the report root (see Report.astro); these
// labels only point at them, so every tab bar on the page stays in sync and no
// script is involved. Rendered as a radiogroup for assistive technology.
---

<div class="kind-tabs" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Measurement kind">
  <label class="kind-tab kind-tab-decode" for="kind-decode">Decode</label>
  <label class="kind-tab kind-tab-prefill" for="kind-prefill">Prefill</label>
</div>
